Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=2}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 50,0:00:09.14,0:00:10.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}We made it here in good time.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:10.60,0:00:13.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Master Cat Viper's a pretty\Nsharp navigator, isn't he?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:13.60,0:00:16.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Though I do suppose he sailed with\Nthe King of the Pirates, after all.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:16.98,0:00:20.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So. How long should we wait\Nat these ruins anyway?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:20.13,0:00:21.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I feel like it's been a while.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:21.83,0:00:25.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Until Master Cat Viper brings\NMarco the Phoenix here, of course!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:25.08,0:00:27.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah? You think he'll do it? I dunno.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:27.92,0:00:31.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I sure hope Marco comes with us\Nto the Land of Wano.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:31.02,0:00:33.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Phoenix would make for\Na pretty powerful ally.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:35.14,0:00:36.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I mean, this guy is the former
Dialogue: 50,0:00:36.76,0:00:39.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,first division commander of the\Ninfamous Whitebeard Pirates,
Dialogue: 50,0:00:39.66,0:00:42.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so he's definitely worth\Nthe effort of coming out here.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:42.15,0:00:45.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was surprised to find out he's\None of Master Cat Viper's friends!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:45.86,0:00:46.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good point!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:46.99,0:00:48.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:48.13,0:00:51.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If this Marco's such a celebrity,\Nthen I want to get a look at him.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:51.30,0:00:53.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:53.66,0:00:55.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let me remind you of something.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:55.29,0:00:59.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Master said to stay put because\Nof your intimidating looks.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:59.27,0:01:03.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is Marco the kind of guy\Nwho'll get scared off by a face?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:03.08,0:01:04.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Listen here!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:04.58,0:01:06.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He was referring to\Nthat quaint little village
Dialogue: 50,0:01:06.82,0:01:09.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,of peace-loving folks\Nup there, you-gara fool!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:09.30,0:01:12.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Big burly warriors like us\Nwill frighten the locals!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:12.89,0:01:17.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see. But Master Cat Viper's features\Nare scarier than mine, I would say!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:17.85,0:01:19.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like when he's mad?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:19.48,0:01:21.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but he does have a cute smile.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:21.57,0:01:23.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Too true!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:40.38,0:01:43.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,-There! -Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:03.02,0:02:05.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay. He's all fixed up now.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:06.40,0:02:07.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're good to go.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:08.69,0:02:10.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He said you're all better now!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:10.95,0:02:13.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tama? Feel good?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:18.69,0:02:20.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't push yourself too hard.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:20.44,0:02:24.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Flames of Restoration only\Nhave a slight effect on others.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:25.50,0:02:29.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Since I patched you up, your natural\Nhealing speed will be faster now.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:29.33,0:02:35.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll be bouncing around by tomorrow!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:35.83,0:02:37.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Marco's magic did the trick!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:37.92,0:02:40.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Say "thank you," Tama!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:50.25,0:02:54.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Looks like you're back to normal!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:54.59,0:02:56.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh boy!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:00.14,0:03:02.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take it easy! I said "by tomorrow"!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:04.06,0:03:06.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the help, Marco!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:06.06,0:03:07.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We love you! 
Dialogue: 50,0:03:14.42,0:03:16.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Marco.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:16.33,0:03:17.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I got a knot in my shoulder.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:17.88,0:03:19.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Marco, I saw a bug near the mountain.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:19.96,0:03:21.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...field could use some TLC.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:22.05,0:03:24.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Marco, I slipped a disc\Nin my back again!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:24.10,0:03:26.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Marco, my knees ache.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:26.94,0:03:30.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Marco, my little brother's\Nbein' real mean to me!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:30.40,0:03:32.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right, all right.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:32.19,0:03:35.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll help you all, but one\Nat a time now, please.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:54.08,0:03:56.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pops built this village, you know.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:57.30,0:03:59.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So he took care of the people here?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:59.51,0:04:02.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that's what you-gara mean?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:02.84,0:04:06.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Countries that are too poor to pay\NHeavenly Tribute to the Celestial Dragons
Dialogue: 50,0:04:06.64,0:04:09.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,are not allowed to join\Nthe World Government at all.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:10.85,0:04:15.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They tend to be lawless lands,\Nwhere pirates and kidnappers run amok.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:15.20,0:04:18.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no one to stop them.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:20.16,0:04:22.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And when the country\Nsuccumbs to collapse,
Dialogue: 50,0:04:22.45,0:04:25.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,it churns out a fresh\Ngeneration of orphans.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:25.71,0:04:29.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pops was one of those kids.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:29.51,0:04:34.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,With nothing left to lose,\Nhe went out to sea at an early age.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:39.81,0:04:43.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even after becoming a pirate,\Nhe cared about this island.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:43.19,0:04:45.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He'd funnel dirty money and\Nsupplies here whenever he could,
Dialogue: 50,0:04:45.88,0:04:48.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but he never revealed who he was.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:48.93,0:04:50.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did it till he died.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:51.77,0:04:56.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He never had a family, and his\Nfriends were all long gone,
Dialogue: 50,0:04:56.40,0:04:58.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but this island was always home to him.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:00.78,0:05:06.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In a corrupt world, there's no such thing\Nas clean or dirty money. It's just money.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:06.08,0:05:07.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Heh.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:07.71,0:05:09.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nice of you to say.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:12.21,0:05:14.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So after the war in Marineford,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:14.13,0:05:16.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,at the very least, we wanted to protect
Dialogue: 50,0:05:16.35,0:05:18.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,this village that Pops loved so much.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:19.81,0:05:22.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's why we started\Na Grudge War with Teach
Dialogue: 50,0:05:22.02,0:05:24.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,when he tried to invade\Nour territory and claim it.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:24.95,0:05:29.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But we were no match for Teach,\Nespecially after he stole Pops' power.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:30.66,0:05:34.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In the end, he took everything.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:37.97,0:05:41.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wanted him to pay,\Nand I wanted to do it myself.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:48.98,0:05:50.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Poor Pops.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:53.07,0:05:56.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's funny. He was\Nkind of a cheapskate.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:04.25,0:06:06.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He'd always\Nmooch drinks off of others...
Dialogue: 50,0:06:07.21,0:06:10.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...and the guy never once\Noffered to cover our tab.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:13.80,0:06:16.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But nobody said a thing, because\Nwe all knew what he was doing
Dialogue: 50,0:06:16.80,0:06:18.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,with the money he saved.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:21.85,0:06:24.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He was sending it to the village. Heh.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:25.74,0:06:27.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, ain't that something.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:28.75,0:06:30.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So that makes this peaceful little spot
Dialogue: 50,0:06:30.75,0:06:34.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the last memento that\Nhe left behind, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:35.71,0:06:37.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:39.59,0:06:41.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He must be grateful.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:41.80,0:06:46.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Red-Haired Shanks\Nmade sure to bury him here.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:46.85,0:06:50.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,By the way, have you heard\Nof a Warlord named Weevil?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:50.89,0:06:53.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He said he's Pops' biological son,
Dialogue: 50,0:06:53.40,0:06:56.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and now he's attacking people\Nconnected to Whitebeard.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:56.79,0:06:58.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wow. Is her claim true?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:58.75,0:07:00.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure honestly.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:00.42,0:07:02.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Never knew his taste in women.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:02.76,0:07:05.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But if I had to guess,\Nthey're after his fortune.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:05.34,0:07:08.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And I doubt they'd believe us\Nif we said there wasn't one.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:10.43,0:07:12.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And you know what? It's a shame.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:12.47,0:07:15.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of time\Nbefore they come for this place.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:15.02,0:07:18.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see. That means\Nyou-gara are stuck here.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:21.62,0:07:24.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Weevil's mother Buckin was a\Npirate back in her younger days.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:25.87,0:07:29.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If I recall correctly, it must\Nhave been about 30 or 40 years ago.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:29.54,0:07:33.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I even heard she used to be\Non the very same ship as Pops.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:35.52,0:07:38.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then maybe, you-gara have\Nanother mentor of his to protect.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:38.86,0:07:43.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not sure about that,\Nconsidering his behavior!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:43.92,0:07:45.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A fine point!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:50.30,0:07:54.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you're going to see Straw Hat Luffy\Nafter this, can you pass on a message?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:54.60,0:07:56.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nothing big.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:56.06,0:07:58.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, not a problem.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:58.43,0:08:00.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You said you're going to Wano?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:00.14,0:08:01.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:06.83,0:08:09.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy! It says the Reverie kicked off!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:10.08,0:08:12.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Royalty from all over are attending!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:12.21,0:08:14.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're at the conference\Nin Marie Jois right now!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:14.80,0:08:16.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:17.63,0:08:21.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"All eyes are on a set of guests who\Nhaven't participated in two centuries!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:21.76,0:08:23.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Ryugu Kingdom!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:23.43,0:08:27.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,King Neptune will be in attendance\Nwith all his children." Ha!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:28.14,0:08:31.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seems like Shirahoshi was\Na big hit with everyone!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:32.15,0:08:34.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That means she went up\Nto the surface, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:34.57,0:08:35.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's getting tougher!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:35.86,0:08:37.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm proud of her!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:39.40,0:08:41.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}It says here that your grandpa\Nwas their personal escort.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:41.95,0:08:43.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Ahh.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:43.49,0:08:47.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sounds like they're making arrangements\Nto relocate Fishmen to the land.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:47.26,0:08:49.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Their dream's coming true!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:53.89,0:08:56.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vivi, my sweet!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:56.60,0:08:58.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're even more beautiful\Nthan I remember!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:58.69,0:09:01.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I just wanna smooch ya! Mwah!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:01.65,0:09:03.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's that? You want another? Mwah!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:03.65,0:09:07.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, do I get some change back?\NLemme get in close!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:07.52,0:09:08.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Knock it off!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:12.42,0:09:13.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vivi!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:13.84,0:09:15.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's really her!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:15.05,0:09:17.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's awesome! It's been a while!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:17.98,0:09:20.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She looks so elegant and formal now!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:20.36,0:09:23.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh! I hope I get to meet her someday!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:23.73,0:09:26.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you think Vivi might be\Ninterested in showing me her panties?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:26.82,0:09:27.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't think so!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:30.87,0:09:34.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ohh. These are photos\Nof the Mingling Plaza.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:34.75,0:09:36.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look at all the royal families.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:36.04,0:09:37.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And tons of bodyguards, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:38.62,0:09:41.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,People from Dressrosa\Nshould be there as well, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:41.78,0:09:43.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There she is! Viola!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:49.36,0:09:51.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ugh! Wapol!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:51.98,0:09:53.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! And Acorn-guy!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:54.07,0:09:56.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Wapol? Why's he there?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:57.42,0:10:00.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's Rebecca and Sai!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:00.17,0:10:02.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know a lotta these guys!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:02.68,0:10:03.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No kidding!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:04.27,0:10:07.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Though I suppose any royalty\Nwe know would be at the Reverie.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:07.06,0:10:08.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's kind of the point.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:10.06,0:10:13.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If that's the case, then just maybe...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:13.91,0:10:18.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All the princesses I've ever met are\Nin the same place at the same time!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:18.65,0:10:22.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I bet they're all getting\Nexcited talking about me!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:22.38,0:10:24.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You keep thinking that, buddy.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:25.13,0:10:27.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chopper, look! Did you see?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:27.25,0:10:28.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:28.50,0:10:29.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right there!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:33.13,0:10:35.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chobro. What's going on?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:43.35,0:10:46.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's Doctorine! 
Dialogue: 50,0:10:46.42,0:10:48.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh... The old bag's still alive?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:55.30,0:10:58.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Doctorine!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:58.34,0:11:00.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Don't cut up the paper!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:00.72,0:11:02.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wanted to save it, Chopper!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:02.48,0:11:03.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:03.81,0:11:05.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give me the section\Nwith the princesses!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:05.48,0:11:07.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you two doing?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:13.57,0:11:14.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You morons!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:14.48,0:11:16.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wasn't finished reading it yet!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:16.66,0:11:18.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's all full of holes now!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:19.45,0:11:22.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh? An article about Kaido?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:24.96,0:11:26.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And Big Mom, too?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:26.25,0:11:28.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh, hang on.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:28.51,0:11:30.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji! Chopper! Gimme those pages back!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:31.09,0:11:32.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Nuh-uh!\N– Nuh-uh!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:33.92,0:11:38.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm glad to hear\Neveryone's doing so good!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:38.37,0:11:41.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Once we're done sailing around\Nthe world, let's go see 'em all!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:41.62,0:11:44.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well! That sounds like\Na novel idea to me.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:44.12,0:11:46.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway, back to\Ngetting things in order.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:46.67,0:11:49.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Have you tried to see if the\NTransponder Snail can connect yet?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:49.55,0:11:51.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, I forgot.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:51.52,0:11:53.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! This is Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:53.44,0:11:54.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is anyone there?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:57.11,0:11:59.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No luck. Nobody picked up.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:59.53,0:12:01.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Forget it. Let's go.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:04.23,0:12:05.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hang on, Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:05.73,0:12:07.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's wrong now?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:07.98,0:12:09.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Feel that wind?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:30.38,0:12:32.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This can't be a good sign.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:32.63,0:12:34.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've never seen waves like those.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:34.97,0:12:36.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And the wind here is freezing cold.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:42.39,0:12:45.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I think this is\Nthe sea around Wano!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:54.35,0:12:57.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you all feel how the wind keeps\Ngetting stronger the closer we get?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:57.86,0:12:59.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And the waves only grow taller?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:00.60,0:13:02.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take notice of how it's spinning.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:02.60,0:13:04.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's not just from the wind currents.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:05.16,0:13:07.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's a very unusual flow.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:08.16,0:13:10.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look, see how it's\Npicking up over there?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:20.31,0:13:22.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I believe we should avoid the storm.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:22.63,0:13:24.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe buy ourselves a little time?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:24.64,0:13:26.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about, Brook?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:26.76,0:13:27.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about that junk!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:27.89,0:13:28.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's keep going!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:28.97,0:13:33.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But Luffy. Why would you deliberately put\Nyour crew in such a dangerous situation?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:35.06,0:13:36.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I dunno, I think he's right.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:37.98,0:13:40.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When we left, Kin'emon did\Ngive me a heads up about this.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:42.11,0:13:45.57,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll explain it, on the\Nauditory snail apparatus!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:46.41,0:13:48.12,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,As you approach the Land of Wano,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:48.45,0:13:51.37,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,you'll find the entrance\Nto be quite perilous!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:51.37,0:13:52.62,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,The weather, grueling.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:52.62,0:13:54.21,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,The tides, violently churning.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:54.67,0:13:56.67,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a difficult country to enter!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:57.26,0:14:00.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? The weather is always this awful?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:00.34,0:14:03.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I suppose we have no other\Nchoice, if that's the case!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:03.03,0:14:05.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And that's why we should just go!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:05.33,0:14:09.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Their samurai warriors are mighty,\Nplus it's this hard to get into?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:09.29,0:14:11.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No wonder it's such\Nan isolated country!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:11.50,0:14:15.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmm. Let me think this over a little.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:15.21,0:14:18.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There has to be some way\Nto get us in there safely.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:22.99,0:14:24.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's that thing?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:24.62,0:14:25.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's an octopus!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:26.16,0:14:27.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That guy's big!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:27.20,0:14:28.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why is it on the ship?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:28.91,0:14:29.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Because we're at sea!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:29.92,0:14:31.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I realize that, Carrot!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:31.95,0:14:34.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When did it come on board?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:35.37,0:14:39.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! While you're over there bickering,\Nthose waters are pulling us in!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:39.34,0:14:40.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:40.75,0:14:42.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:42.51,0:14:48.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,C'mon, Sunny! Let's go\Nto the Land of Wano!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:02.62,0:15:05.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! It looks like something's\Ncoming towards us!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:09.24,0:15:11.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh. What is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:11.16,0:15:13.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It kinda looks like a giant fish to me!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:13.24,0:15:14.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is it a shark?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:14.54,0:15:15.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please, no!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:17.21,0:15:18.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's gonna get us!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:27.38,0:15:29.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Koi fish?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:29.14,0:15:30.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh wow! Cool!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:33.57,0:15:35.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's huge! Ha!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:43.91,0:15:45.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A whole school of koi!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:52.98,0:15:54.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell are those\Nthings doing in the sea?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:55.35,0:15:56.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're freshwater fish!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:56.60,0:15:58.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How can they survive?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:58.15,0:16:01.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who knows! They're monsters anyway!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:01.15,0:16:03.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji?\NDo these things fry up okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:03.57,0:16:06.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That stuff's not important right now!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:06.77,0:16:08.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I guess it's possible.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:08.69,0:16:12.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you wash them in hot water and then\Nserve them chilled, you can make arai.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:12.44,0:16:14.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Or I can simmer them in some miso.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:14.55,0:16:17.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can batter 'em up and make tempura\Nor simmer 'em in sweet sauce.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:18.06,0:16:20.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sounds good!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:21.31,0:16:24.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Once we find the rest of the crew,\Nlet's celebrate with one of these!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:24.52,0:16:26.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll drown, Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:26.19,0:16:28.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Plus, koi have way too many bones!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:28.53,0:16:29.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who cares about that?!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:29.91,0:16:31.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's the least important\Nthing right now, Carrot!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:38.33,0:16:39.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Don't struggle!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:39.90,0:16:41.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course it's gonna struggle!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:41.82,0:16:43.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You think it's gonna\Njust let you eat it?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:44.20,0:16:46.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And Sanji. You're the one who\Nput this dumb idea in his head,
Dialogue: 50,0:16:46.96,0:16:48.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so you go bring him back!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:48.84,0:16:50.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not that big of a deal.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:50.67,0:16:52.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You know he can manage on his own.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:52.18,0:16:53.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:53.64,0:16:55.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's just worry about\Nprotecting the Sunny.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:17.50,0:17:18.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The wind is picking up!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:18.55,0:17:20.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Carrot, furl the sail!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:20.20,0:17:21.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,On it!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:21.34,0:17:22.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lemme help!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:41.40,0:17:44.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Crazy! Look how clean the water is!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:44.16,0:17:46.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's crystal clear,\Nlike a mountain stream!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:46.66,0:17:48.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'd rather not see,\Nthank you very much!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:49.01,0:17:51.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The giant fish are freaking me out!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:51.71,0:17:54.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Is this a river? No way.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:55.34,0:17:57.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It looks like they're all\Nheaded to the same place.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:59.97,0:18:01.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hang on tight!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:01.22,0:18:02.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're just along for the ride now!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:03.65,0:18:05.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is Luffy still around?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:12.78,0:18:13.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:16.45,0:18:19.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell? How's that possible?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:19.80,0:18:21.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The river's flowing into the waterfall,
Dialogue: 50,0:18:22.70,0:18:24.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,not away from it, like usual!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:35.20,0:18:38.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see. There must be a massive fresh\Nwater source at the top of the falls.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:39.35,0:18:41.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's why it's not seawater.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:41.55,0:18:44.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wonder, could that be Wano up there?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:44.93,0:18:46.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You think that's it?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:46.31,0:18:48.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,None of this makes any sense!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:48.43,0:18:50.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm scared! Terrified!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:51.27,0:18:52.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:13.06,0:19:14.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, cool!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:14.30,0:19:16.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The fish are climbing the waterfall!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:16.51,0:19:18.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They are!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:25.58,0:19:27.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go koi fish! Go koi fish!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:28.63,0:19:31.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure how we can\Nget the Sunny up there!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:31.13,0:19:32.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll sink if we take it head on!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:32.51,0:19:34.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Open to suggestions right now!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:35.60,0:19:36.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're back!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:36.89,0:19:40.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wow! You see that? Those koi are tough!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:40.04,0:19:42.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can admire the fish later!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:42.21,0:19:44.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy! The ship's going to sink!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:44.80,0:19:46.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right! I got this!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:46.10,0:19:47.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:48.97,0:19:50.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You should probably hang on tight!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:56.62,0:19:58.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lead the way, fish!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:58.46,0:20:00.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:02.25,0:20:03.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:21.12,0:20:23.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:27.35,0:20:30.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're doin' it!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:52.69,0:20:56.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You know, I'm starting to think\NWano isn't going to be very nice.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:56.61,0:20:58.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sick of this chaos!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:58.20,0:21:00.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys! That's the shore over there!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:07.51,0:21:10.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, not awesome!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:16.94,0:21:19.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Let go of the fish!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:19.19,0:21:21.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, never! They're my dinner!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:22.07,0:21:24.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've had enough of you!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:25.49,0:21:27.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Brook! Take the helm!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:27.49,0:21:28.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As you wish, Nami!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:39.84,0:21:42.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No use! The current's way too strong!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:48.01,0:21:50.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit! And we were almost there, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:50.96,0:21:55.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It was nice knowing you!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:55.18,0:21:56.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Doctorine!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:00.10,0:22:03.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Where're my koi?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:03.39,0:22:05.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Priorities, Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:18.03,0:22:21.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh no! We're getting flushed!
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=3}===============================DIALOGUE============================
